  "whyScoutCares": "The interaction model is the artifact: a joystick that maps a continuous 2D plane of crossfading wavetables, in place of discrete patch selection. Commercially shipped, well-sourced, with two clean freely-licensed photos. Distinct from every other input paradigm in the collection.",
